# P103 on GtkBackend on macOS (TEST_BACKEND=gtk4), part 1: a tap toggles, a long press opens the picker and does NOT toggle.
# Positions from the GTK window on 2026-10-17 (960x1970 px = 480x985 pt at 2x; origin=frame, 28 pt title bar):
# rows' emoji at x 43, y 233 (停車場) / 277 (便利商店); SOLO emoji at 81,431.
